{#
  What the former site said of an imported email, shown as it said it
  (decision D6): when it left, to which list — a name only, never re-read
  against today's members — and from whom. The section the email hangs on
  is only the one this site recognised from that address.

  Usage:
  {% include '@mass_mail/partials/_imported_origin.html.twig' with {
      email: email,
      sender: original_senders[email.id] ?? null,
  } only %}
#}
<span class="d-block small text-body-secondary">
    Envoyé le {{ email.sentAt|date_fr }}
    {%- if email.originalAudienceName %} · Liste « {{ email.originalAudienceName }} » (nom d'origine){% endif %}
    {%- if sender %} · De : {% if sender.name %}{{ sender.name }} &lt;{{ sender.address }}&gt;{% else %}{{ sender.address }}{% endif %}{% endif %}
</span>
